{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50990","headline":"句 四 · 杨徽之","name":"句 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开尽菊花秋色老，落残桐叶雨声寒。\n（《宿东林》以上八句并见《宋诗纪事》卷二。\n均见《玉壶清话》卷五、《渑水燕谈录》卷七，宋太宗曾书於御屏。）","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨徽之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}